{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTWVzc2lhaC0lMjgyMDIwJTI5LTcyMHAv","type":"series","name":"Messiah 720p","description":"A wary CIA officer investigates a charismatic man who sparks a spiritual movement and stirs political unrest. Who exactly is he? And what does he want?\n\nRated TV-MA · Canceled · First aired 1 Jan 2020 · United States of America · Language: English\nStudio: Industry Entertainment Partners, Think Pictures, MGM Television · Network: Netflix\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 10/10\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2020","genres":["Drama","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTWVzc2lhaC0lMjgyMDIwJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.1","title":"He That Hath an Ear","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Believing he miraculously delivered Damascus from ruin, a throng follows a man they call al-Masih into the desert, raising suspicions in the CIA.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uvXWvwSvfay2SoN5dtHWuDt6LOK.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTWVzc2lhaC0lMjgyMDIwJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.2","title":"Tremor","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In Israel, tensions rise while CIA officer Eva seeks answers, and dramatic footage of al-Masih goes viral. In Texas, a desperate pastor forms a plan.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1iokGHsr1Ft4Vj4odh5Mgi2b8wi.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTWVzc2lhaC0lMjgyMDIwJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.3","title":"The Finger of God","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Appearing inexplicably during a Texas tornado, al-Masih quietly moves pastor Felix to embrace a new purpose. But Eva -- and the FBI -- quickly close in.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ypyHP3MG3UXZ3ZkbUaiPyenGmBO.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTWVzc2lhaC0lMjgyMDIwJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.4","title":"Trial","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Coping with grief, Eva questions al-Masih, but his riveting charisma turns the tables. A deportation trial becomes a political lightning rod.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f9zhFStW8R9jxUCzuzXihWdRqz.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTWVzc2lhaC0lMjgyMDIwJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.5","title":"So That Seeing They May Not See","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"While Eva keeps close watch on al-Masih, Felix wrestles with what to believe as his church becomes a magnet for the devout and the desperate.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k45lsazm3fzZfqRoRG9i2TDP9My.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTWVzc2lhaC0lMjgyMDIwJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.6","title":"We Will Not All Sleep","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Jibril has a striking vision in the desert. Eva finally gets hard intel on al-Masih, whose devotees form a convoy to follow him out of Texas.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5jQv3DavUO4hiqWrvEKxaPZ79iU.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTWVzc2lhaC0lMjgyMDIwJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.7","title":"It Came to Pass as It Was Spoken","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"News of a marvel electrifies the phenomenon around al-Masih, but Eva's skepticism deepens. Jibril's and Samer's paths diverge amid political unrest.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/udGli7ZO2po201N3ka5ET4XlMcy.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTWVzc2lhaC0lMjgyMDIwJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.8","title":"Force Majeure","season":1,"episod